sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Gateway as Moderation Gateway
    participant Inference as Inference Service
    participant Calibrator as Decision Calibrator
    participant Enforcement as Enforcement Worker
    participant Queue as Review Queue
    participant Reviewer
    participant Audit as Audit Ledger

    User->>Gateway: Submit UGC Event
    Gateway->>Inference: Request multi-model evaluation
    Inference-->>Gateway: Return risk scores & features
    Gateway->>Calibrator: Forward scores for policy mapping

    alt High Confidence (Auto Action)
        Calibrator->>Enforcement: Automated Decision (e.g. remove, demote, allow)
        Enforcement-->>User: Apply enforcement (Serving side effect)
        Enforcement->>Audit: Log Automated Action
    else Uncertain / Low Confidence (Escalation)
        Calibrator->>Queue: Enqueue for human review
        Queue->>Reviewer: Assign task based on SLA
        Reviewer->>Enforcement: Submit Manual Decision
        Enforcement-->>User: Apply enforcement (Serving side effect)
        Enforcement->>Audit: Log Manual Action
    end
